Z||000018||mshill||02-17-2000||11:06 PM||||That's a drag.  I am glad that where I work you have to show ID to a security guard on the way in.  One of my Fieros is in the garage (currently with cradle out) and the other is behind a gate on the side yard.  I hate leaving any of my cars in parking lots for very long and definitely never on the street.  ||||reg||1
Z||000019||FieroSTETZ||02-18-2000||12:10 AM||||well, as an identifying mark, the quarter window thing on the driver's side has stickers that form the words "hot sh*t" (it actually is a star, no dirty word) i don't recall the plate number (just got my plate numbers changed, my parents wouldnt let me park out front with 3hz9666 as my license plate number (they're religious) it is a 1986 SE 2m6 4spd, and the right side exhaust tip hangs a little lower than the left (muffler shop only replaced the mount on one side). well, thanks for the sympathy, I will keep you all posted||||reg||1
